msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-2\">From the Canopy to Rugged Trails</span>\n"
"                                            <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-2\">De la canopée aux sentiers sauvages</span>\n"
"                                            <br/>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_activities
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-2\">The great lake of Wood Haven is your endless "
"playground. Glide across the calm morning waters on a kayak or paddleboard, "
"or get your adrenaline pumping at the helm of a jet ski carving through the "
"waves. From an invigorating swim off our natural beach to boat rides under "
"the golden evening light, experience the vastness of the lake in all its "
"forms.</span>\n"
"                                            <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-2\">Le grand lac de Wood Haven est votre terrain "
"de jeu sans limites. Glissez sur les eaux calmes du matin en kayak ou en "
"paddle, ou faites le plein d’adrénaline aux commandes d’un jet-ski qui fend "
"les vagues. D’une baignade revigorante depuis notre plage naturelle aux "
"promenades en bateau dans la lumière dorée du soir, découvrez toutes les "
"facettes de l’immensité du lac.</span>\n"
"                                            <br/>"

#. module: holiday_house
